<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f6f9;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      .header {
        background-color: #d33f49;
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 20px;
      }
      .content {
        margin-top: 20px;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #333;
      }
      .cta-button {
        background-color: #4CAF50;
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 15px 25px;
        text-align: center;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        width: 48%;
        margin-right: 4%;
      }
      .cta-button:last-child {
        margin-right: 0;
      }
      .cta-button:hover {
        background-color: #45a049;
      }
      .image-container {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
      .footer {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #777;
        margin-top: 30px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .footer a {
        color: #4CAF50;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .highlight {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #d33f49;
      }
      .email-link {
        color: #4CAF50;
      }
      .button-container {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        Account Locked - Action Required
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Hello <%= @name %>,</p>

        <p>Greetings from COD King Team.</p>
        <p>Your SMS and WhatsApp notifications, including OTP (if enabled), have been temporarily stopped because your account has exceeded the capped amount for this month.</p>

        <h3 class="highlight">To Unlock Your Account:</h3>
        <ol>
          <li>Go to the <b>Summary</b> tab in the COD King app.</li>
          <li>Click on the <b>"Unlock Now"</b> button under the account lock banner.</li>
          <li>Once clicked, the system will process your request, and you will regain access to your notifications.</li>
        </ol>

        <h3>Example of the Unlock Button:</h3>
        <div class="image-container">
          <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0743/3119/3628/files/account_locked.png?v=1745494325" alt="Unlock Now Button Screenshot" style="max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px;" />
        </div>

        <div class="button-container">
          <a href="<%= @shopify_domain %>" class="cta-button" target="_blank">
            Unlock Now
          </a>
          <a href="<%= @crisp_url %>" class="cta-button" target="_blank">
            Chat with Us Now
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>If you have any questions or need further assistance, feel free to reach out to us by reaching us through email - support@notifiktech.com or through our <a href="<%= @crisp_url %>" class="email-link" target="_blank">instant chat</a>.</p>
        <p>Regards,</p>
        <p><b>COD King Team</b></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
